From 2a5a232581e1b2c6a6bd2e7fad3311ef240de9ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ricardo Salveti <ricardo.salveti@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 19:29:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] configs: qcom: re-enable the SoC clock drivers in SPL

Commit 7c85dcadfb60 ("clk: qcom: add SPL Kconfig options for Qualcomm
clock drivers") builds each Qualcomm clock driver into SPL only when its
SPL_CLK_QCOM_<SOC> option is set, but only the Shikra SPL defconfig was
updated. The Lemans, SDM845 and IPQ5210 SPLs lost the GCC driver they
used to get through CLK_QCOM_<SOC>, so the Lemans SPL can no longer look
up the UFS core reset and fails to boot:

  qcom-ufshcd ufshc@1d84000: failed to get reset, ret:-19
  spl: ufs: scsi scan failed: -19

Enable the SPL variant of each SoC's clock driver. Nord Ride already
sets SPL_CLK_QCOM_NORD_NEGCC.

Signed-off-by: Ricardo Salveti <ricardo.salveti@oss.qualcomm.com>

Proposed to the qualcomm-linux qcom-next branch, as the Lemans SPL
support and the SPL clock options have not landed upstream yet.

Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://github.com/qualcomm-linux/u-boot/pull/214]
---
 configs/qcom_ipq5210_mmc_defconfig | 1 +
 configs/qcom_lemans_spl_defconfig  | 1 +
 configs/qcom_sdm845_spl_defconfig  | 1 +
 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/configs/qcom_ipq5210_mmc_defconfig b/configs/qcom_ipq5210_mmc_defconfig
index 56a22ce346a..6e80581223a 100644
--- a/configs/qcom_ipq5210_mmc_defconfig
+++ b/configs/qcom_ipq5210_mmc_defconfig
@@ -69,6 +69,7 @@ CONFIG_SPL_DM_GPIO=y
 CONFIG_SPL_DM_RESET=y
 CONFIG_SPL_PINCTRL=y
 CONFIG_SPL_CLK=y
+CONFIG_SPL_CLK_QCOM_IPQ5210=y
 CONFIG_SPL_DRIVERS_MISC=y
 CONFIG_SPL_DRIVERS_MISC_SUPPORT=y
 CONFIG_SPL_SERIAL=y
diff --git a/configs/qcom_lemans_spl_defconfig b/configs/qcom_lemans_spl_defconfig
index 4f556c916c3..ef055b6e74e 100644
--- a/configs/qcom_lemans_spl_defconfig
+++ b/configs/qcom_lemans_spl_defconfig
@@ -52,6 +52,7 @@ CONFIG_SPL_SIMPLE_BUS=y
 CONFIG_SPL_DM_RESET=y
 
 CONFIG_SPL_CLK=y
+CONFIG_SPL_CLK_QCOM_SA8775P=y
 
 CONFIG_SPL_GPIO=y
 CONFIG_SPL_DM_GPIO=y
diff --git a/configs/qcom_sdm845_spl_defconfig b/configs/qcom_sdm845_spl_defconfig
index 375647e71ba..2686c087ed1 100644
--- a/configs/qcom_sdm845_spl_defconfig
+++ b/configs/qcom_sdm845_spl_defconfig
@@ -64,6 +64,7 @@ CONFIG_SPL_CLK=y
 CONFIG_CLK_STUB=y
 CONFIG_SPL_CLK_STUB=y
 CONFIG_CLK_QCOM_SDM845=y
+CONFIG_SPL_CLK_QCOM_SDM845=y
 CONFIG_DFU_MMC=y
 CONFIG_DFU_RAM=y
 CONFIG_DFU_SCSI=y
-- 
2.43.0

